    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33196" root="فخر" body-key="f">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفخّر</span></b>  (S, TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفاخر</span></b>  (TA) <i>He magnified himself; he was,</i> or <i>became, proud, haughty,</i>
or <i>disdainful;</i> syn. of the inf. n. of the former
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَظُّمٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَكَبُّرٌ</span>; (S, TA;) and that of the latter
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَاظُمٌ</span>. (TA.)

